      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Introduction&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;introduction&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#introduction&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You&amp;rsquo;re a solopreneur. You wear every hat.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Monday: You&amp;rsquo;re the founder making strategy decisions.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Tuesday: You&amp;rsquo;re the marketer posting on LinkedIn.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Wednesday: You&amp;rsquo;re the customer service rep answering support tickets.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Thursday: You&amp;rsquo;re the accountant invoicing clients.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Friday: You&amp;rsquo;re the operations person scheduling calls and managing files.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;By Sunday, you&amp;rsquo;re exhausted. You&amp;rsquo;re billing 30 hours, but working 60. You&amp;rsquo;re profitable, but barely sane.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
